      "text": "영작문제 1 답안"
    },
    {
      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "다음 문제를 영작해주세요."
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "Was it cool last week?"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Was this your rifle?"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "Was this handgun yours?"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Were the government officials honest?"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "Were Democrats and Republicans cooperative?"
        },
        {
          "n": "25",
          "text": "Does the federal government have a good policy?"
        },
        {
          "n": "26",
          "text": "Do your son(s) and daughter(s) have pets(a pet)?"
        },
        {
          "n": "27",
          "text": "Don't your parents have a problem?"
        },
        {
          "n": "28",
          "text": "Doesn't the senator have an option?"
        },
        {
          "n": "29",
          "text": "Doesn't the congressman wake your mother up?"
        },
        {
          "n": "30",
          "text": "Does the operator like it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "31",
          "text": "Didn't the financial district face a major rebuilding job?"
        },
        {
          "n": "32",
          "text": "Did his wife change his life?"
        },
        {
          "n": "33",
          "text": "Does your husband mean it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "34",
          "text": "Do your friends really mean it?"
        },
        {
          "n": "35",
          "text": "Doesn't your commander show proper respect for the dead?"
        },
        {
          "n": "36",
          "text": "Does the machine work that way?"
        },
        {
          "n": "37",
          "text": "Do they take airplanes frequently(often)?"
        },
        {
          "n": "38",
          "text": "Didn't the terrorist plant a bomb in the car?"
        },
        {
          "n": "39",
          "text": "Why does it take place(happen) outside the border?"
        }
      ]
    },
